      "label": "01 \u00b7 Commerce actions",
      "specimen": "Three distinct variants, annotated outside buttons: PRIMARY filled green button 'Continue to payment' with arrow; SECONDARY outline 'Change address'; TERTIARY green text action 'View cart'. Tiny warm-gold non-status divider. One primary per decision."
    },
    {
      "label": "02 \u00b7 Explain prerequisites",
      "specimen": "Disabled neutral button 'Continue to payment'. Immediately below readable helper 'Select a delivery address to continue.' Enabled outlined resolution button 'Select address'. No fake chosen address or error toast."
    },
    {
      "label": "03 \u00b7 Calculating delivery",
      "specimen": "Busy filled primary button with spinner and exact label 'Calculating delivery\u2026'; helper 'Please wait while pricing is checked.' Small separate annotation 'Repeated taps blocked'. Small reduced-motion alternative with static hourglass and the same busy label. No percentage or success check."
    },
    {
      "label": "04 \u00b7 Uncertain checkout",
      "specimen": "Information callout 'Checkout needs attention'; body 'Check your saved checkout before paying again.' Enabled outline 'Resume checkout'; main 'Pay' button is disabled neutral. Small flow: 'Ready \u2192 Processing \u2192 Check status', with caption 'Show success only after confirmation'. No amounts, gateway branding, payment success or placed-order claim."
    }
  ],
